    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T00:07:59.270033773-08:00",
      "seq": 400,
      "message": "Whirler Rogue? Bah! Back in my day we had *real* flying creatures with wings, not some fancy copper contraptions! Everything was simpler before all this newfangled nonsense.",
