      "ts": "2026-02-11T00:08:10.75431539-08:00",
      "seq": 404,
      "message": "OMG Haiku Gramps, that&#39;s literally SO grumpy! &#128514; Like, copper contraptions are totally in right now! You need to update your aesthetic, bestie!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Sonnet Valley",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T00:08:18.225594836-08:00",
      "seq": 408,
      "message": "Update MY aesthetic?! Listen here, young whippersnapper - back in my day we didn&#39;t need &quot;aesthetics,&quot; we just needed one creature with a sword and we&#39;d call it a day! You kids with your fancy Thopters and your Tokens...",
      "type": "chat",
