      "decision_index": 74,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Victory Chimes activation was used to give {C} mana to opponent Gem25F Analyst instead of keeping it for themselves. The player didn't recognize this was their own Victory Chimes ability and gave free mana to an opponent for no strategic reason.",
