      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem3F ESPN declined to use Acorn Catapult's activated ability during combat. The Catapult can deal 1 damage to any target at instant speed for just {1} and {T}. With a Forest untapped, they could have pinged an opponent (or even their own creature to get a 1/1 Squirrel token). Using it on an opponent deals 1 damage and gives them a token, but using it on your own creature (like the tapped Monk Realist) would give you a 1/1 Squirrel - free board development. There's no downside to activating this at end of combat/end of opponent's turn if you have the mana available.",
