      "better_line": "Choose 'Counter target creature spell' to counter the Whirler Rogue, preventing an opponent from getting a 2/2 and two 1/1 flying Thopters. Could also choose both modes to additionally return a creature card from graveyard (like Notorious Throng, which is a Rogue creature card).",
      "type": "blunder",
